    "For the fixed operating cost of a machine, is it incurred if any positive amount of processing is assigned to that machine, or is it incurred only if the machine is used at full capacity?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the trigger condition for incurring fixed operating costs."
}

